  "_title": "The half adder — your first calculation",
  "_description": "One XOR and one AND, and the machine can add one bit to one bit. SUM is the XOR (1+0 = 1, and 1+1 = 0 because it carried), CARRY is the AND. Set both switches: SUM goes dark and CARRY lights — that is binary 1+1 = 10, read across two LEDs. It is called HALF because it has nowhere to put a carry coming IN.",
